  "message": "LASALLIANS WALK OUT AGAINST PAX SILICA, DONALD TRUMP\n\nThe Lasallian community staged an academic walkout and snake rally across the DLSU Manila Campus today, November 13, to condemn the proposed Pax Silica initiative and US President Donald Trump’s visit during the 49th ASEAN Summit.\n\nOrganized by Lasallians Against Pax Silica, the protest condemned US imperialism and the Philippine government’s perceived complacency, criticizing both the Trump and Marcos administrations. Protesters also raised concerns over the initiative’s potential impacts on local lands and indigenous communities.\n\nStudents from De La Salle-College of Saint Benilde and other Lasallian organizations also joined the demonstation, chanting slogans such as “Lupa sa Magsasaka! Hindi sa Pax Silica!”\n\n#ARCHNews #DLSUNews #ARCH #ArchersNetwork",
